                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَنَجٍّ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Going,</i> or <i>being, away</i> from (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ</span>) a
place, person, or thing. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَنَحًّى</span> [<i>A place to
